{
  "comment": "glTF core PBR permutation matrix (plan F1 Task 4, spec K-A / 6.1). Axes: TIER x FG_SKIN x FG_MORPH x FG_UNLIT = 24 define sets per stage. Each target compiles the define sets of its backend tier (spec 6.1), so 8 per target per stage, 56 per stage, 112 compiles in all. scripts/compile_shaders.py checks that 'excluded' is exactly the complement of 'tiers'.",
  "source": "shaders/pbr/pbr.hlsl",
  "entries": [
